WEBVTT

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:42.740
<b>11: Seijoukyou</b>

00:01:45.330 --> 00:02:01.470
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:52.870
What are you trying to accomplish?

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:54.170
Ow!

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:56.750
Can't you tie me up more gently?

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.390
I can't.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.650
You're stronger than the 
guys I buried before you.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:06.490
Hey, are you going to put me in that hole?

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:08.410
Yep.

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.410
H-Hey...

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.780
Why are you pouring water in there?

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.760
If I use mud that's equal 
parts water and dirt,

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:26.190
it sticks to your body and
prevents you from using

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.780
those strange techniques you call tai chi.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:34.330
Also, being buried in mud 
is pretty comfortable.

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:39.440
If I do this, you won't be able to escape.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:41.670
You shouldn't be so good at this!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.390
This is turning into quite the problem.

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:47.550
Maybe I should adjust the depth.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.810
<i>Fuukou Qimen!</i>

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.190
<i>Rankintaku!</i>

00:02:53.730 --> 00:03:04.180
Hey, sister, brush your hair and stick 
a pin in it, in your willow-like hair...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:03.550
<i>I took control of time, 
but she's unaffected by it?</i>

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.660
Gon Jiryuuyuu!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.860
Oh, shoot. He escaped.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:15.710
Kawaguruma!

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:25.270
I'll be leaving now, miss.

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:28.510
You really are stronger than the others.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.510
What kind of kung fu is this?

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.610
You won't escape this time.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:40.190
<i>My Rankintaku and Kawaguruma 
didn't work against her.</i>

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.650
<i>Who is this girl?!</i>

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.330
Hey, Soran. Out for a walk?

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.410
Yeah. How about you?

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:54.280
I'm on my way to see my sister.

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:57.420
With my skills, she'll heal faster.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:59.550
In that case, I'll go with you.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:03.810
I wasn't expecting you to make it this far.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:06.550
What if you actually become the next Tenshi?

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.560
Don't joke about that.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:13.220
The Tenshi should be someone 
strong and of good character.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:15.600
Stop, Tenshi!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.220
I can't!

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.680
But I have nothing to do with this!

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.320
You're abandoning me?

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.320
Stop, you old fart!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:26.310
I'll break that skinny neck of yours!

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.760
Wh-What happened there?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.450
Actually, during this afternoon's match...

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.330
Reigyoku-sama.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.330
I won't let you go easy on me
just because I'm a woman.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:42.210
I've trained hard for this day.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:48.130
If it's what you desire, 
then I shall do my best.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.510
That's the spirit!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.730
Grandpa...

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.720
How dare he do that to my granddaughter?!

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:04.100
As his master, you'll pay for 
mismanaging your apprentice!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.790
But they fought fair and square!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:11.370
That's not my problem! Stop!

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:13.820
Let's go...

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:19.310
Oh, young lord.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.410
Are you here to see your sister?

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:22.590
Good for you.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:25.770
Shinton, I'm a fan of yours.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:26.740
Let me get a picture.

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.480
Do you remember me, Shinton?

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.960
You've gotten pretty popular.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.020
I'm coming in, Sis.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.640
Oh, Shinton.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:37.820
Good evening.

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.610
You came too, Soran-kun?

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:44.200
Chairman Fuu, Shinton's 
match today was incredible.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.390
Not that incredible.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.820
He just got lucky.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.830
Dad, there's no need to be so modest.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:57.950
Shinton's odds actually surpassed Chou 
Reigyoku's, making him the favorite.

00:05:58.220 --> 00:05:59.790
What? Really?

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.770
Don't look at me like I'm 
some kind of monster.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:07.160
My dad's right. I just got lucky.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.810
I was matched up with the right opponent.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:17.950
That hurts!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.890
Yuufuku-san, what's 
possessing you right now?

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.500
No one's possessing me right now.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.360
I'm simply borrowing some strength.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:32.850
I've heard rumors of the Fuu 
family's summoning techniques.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:35.450
Kourei Kenshou, I believe it's called?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:39.120
It certainly is impressive to see in person.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:43.080
To think you'd commune with 
so many spirits at once.

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:49.520
Yuufuku-san, your techniques can't beat me.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:55.510
Based on simple numbers, 
there are indeed more of you.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.690
But we are many in one body.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:01.510
I only form agreements with special spirits.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.950
The shamans of Hakutousan prioritize

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:09.360
forming agreements with the 
most powerful spirits possible.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:15.410
It's not unusual to form an agreement after 
generations have spilled their blood.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.250
And once an agreement is reached,

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:22.420
that spirit is worshiped and 
respected as a family ancestor.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:26.430
It's why our spirits are 
called Family Spirits.

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:32.980
I shall now show you the power of 
the spirit I've served for years!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:40.380
Please grant your strength to the unworthy 
Yuufuku the Third of the Tou family!

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.200
Ryuu Konsei-sama!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.080
I suddenly felt a chill.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.750
What is that black smoke?

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.540
Foolish Yuufuku.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:09.250
He summoned me against this green youth.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:15.310
So this is Ryuu Konsei.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.300
Too scared to move, boy?

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.140
What a fantastic power!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:26.810
Has the fear made you go mad?

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:33.930
Come.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.350
Come to me!

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:47.290
What did you do to Ryuu-sama?

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.830
Don't lose your head.

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.450
I'm just borrowing his strength for a bit.

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:55.750
Calm yourself.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.980
Don't worry.

00:09:01.980 --> 00:09:05.930
I know he's an important spirit to you.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.080
I won't use him to do anything bad,

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:12.040
and I'll return him as soon 
as this tournament is over.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.650
Fuu Shinton...

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.950
I choose to believe you.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:20.700
If you fail to return Ryuu-sama 
by the end of the tournament,

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.860
I'll take him back,
even if it means killing you!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:30.790
Yuufuku-san, to be honest, 
I was a little angry earlier.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.400
You scornfully called my Kourei Kenshou

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:37.680
a technique for controlling 
a hodgepodge of spirits.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:41.600
It's true that I control various spirits.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.710
Some of them aren't good at combat.

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:49.490
After all, all spirits must submit 
when faced with my technique.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:55.330
But I never look down on spirits.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:59.160
No matter the spirit, 
if they'll stay by my side,

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:02.180
then they're all dear friends to me.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:09.370
Anyway, this Ryuu-sama's power 
really is limitless, huh?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:13.850
I'll show his true strength 
in my next match.

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:20.570
Since I won so easily, everyone seems to 
think I'm some kind of incredible master.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:26.170
Chairman Fuu, is it okay to be using 
Kourei Kenshou in front of everyone?

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:28.880
I know what you're trying to say.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:33.850
But I considered it carefully before 
I gave Shinton permission to use it.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.390
We no longer live in troubled times.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:39.980
There's no need to try so hard to 
conceal the eight secret arts.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:43.050
In any case, you did well, Shinton.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:47.660
After your match, the Elders' attitude 
toward me changed dramatically.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:53.000
By the way, Saen-san, how are your injuries?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.440
Oh, right. Shinton.

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:56.420
Tend to Saen's wounds.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:00.060
He's more seriously injured than I am.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:03.470
I told you, Mom, I didn't lose.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:07.670
The match ended in an instant 
when I used my Zansentou.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:12.400
But I felt bad for my opponent since she 
was on the verge of tears, so I let her win.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:16.330
You taught me to be nice to girls, after all.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:19.300
Oh, but I won't be able 
to come home for a while.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:24.730
I'm busy meeting Elders who want to curry 
favor with me after seeing me fight.

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:26.650
You don't need to heal him.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.230
Give me a break!

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:30.050
I just stretched the truth a little!

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:32.910
My mom would freak out otherwise!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.370
Soran-kun.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:35.020
Think you can win tomorrow's match?

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:36.030
I mean, just look at these wounds...

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:38.400
Your opponent is Ouya, 
the man who beat Shokatsu Sei.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:38.400
Are you ignoring me?

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.400
Hey, come on! Are you listening?!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:42.270
I'm not too confident, 
but I'm sure it'll work out.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.920
I'm gonna go make a call.

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:53.930
<i>What?</i>

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.650
Hou-nee, I know it's late, 
but how are you doing?

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.850
Stop calling.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.980
<i>I promise I'll succeed.</i>

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:03.700
<i>The next time you call me, 
I'm burying you, too.</i>

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.410
What a persistent girl.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.400
Ken Mekakushi!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.910
Hyakka Ryouryan!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.290
<i>She won't be able to catch me now.</i>

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.340
<i>No way!</i>

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.600
Reifu Mekakushikou!

00:12:40.270 --> 00:12:42.320
<i>That should do it.</i>

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.000
Good morning, everyone.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.220
Ah, Chairman Fuu.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:57.830
Uh, Tenshi...

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.670
What happened to your face?

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:06.760
Oh, I was trying to develop a new ultimate 
technique, and I made a mistake.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:09.860
It looks like someone hit you.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.500
You need more training.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.780
Once you reach my level, you'll understand.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.920
I was naïve.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:23.470
The starting time of the match has passed.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:27.440
Ouya, please make your way 
to the arena immediately.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:31.670
Is Chou Soran going to win 
without fighting again?

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.210
Where's Houhou?

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:39.580
The match has started, but Ouya 
has not arrived at the arena.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.870
The winner of the match is...

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:42.580
<i>Hou-nee really is dependable.</i>

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.660
Look! Ouya's here!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:52.690
Goal!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.940
Mekakushikou, dispel!

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.700
Enough already!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:07.180
Is burying people all you think about?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.370
Take a look around you!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:09.510
Huh?

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:35.050
I thought she was a crazy 
Shokatsu Sei fan at first,

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:38.320
but I realized right away that she wasn't.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:46.310
Then I remembered she was wearing an 
Express Delivery uniform like yours.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:51.900
Not bad, you coward.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:56.490
Ouya, explain what just happened.

00:14:56.850 --> 00:15:00.880
If you wish, we can postpone the match.

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:04.630
No need, Fukutoku-senpai.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:06.250
Let's get this match started.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:10.330
Oh, right. Could you give 
me something to eat?

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:13.180
I'm so hungry, I can't fight.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.350
Oh, I'd like some mantou.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.740
Are you trying to be funny?!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.970
If you're going to fight, 
hurry up and get started!

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.630
Of course I'll compete.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:28.400
But there's no rule at the Raten Taishou 
that says we have to fight each other.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.920
I'm going to challenge him 
to an eating contest.

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:32.400
How's that?

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:47.000
Don't just stand there. Start eating.

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:50.060
If you don't eat, I'll kill you in one blow.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:55.740
You don't often fail, Houhou-chan.

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:59.360
If Houhou couldn't handle him, 
isn't Soran-kun in danger?

00:15:59.650 --> 00:16:03.010
You haven't said a word. 
What are you thinking about?

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.650
I've got it.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:09.020
Next time, I'll knock them out after 
tying them up and <i>before</i> I bury them.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:12.620
Houhou, stop thinking about burying people!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.580
Come on, you're covered 
in mud! Go get changed!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:23.610
Ouya-san, why are you participating 
in this tournament?

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.420
Why, huh?

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:32.390
It's hard to explain in a few words.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:37.230
Chou Soran, do you know 
about fortune telling?

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.210
No.

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:43.000
Then I'll teach you the basics.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.730
You can't change the past, 
but you can change the future.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:55.190
Not even the greatest 
fangshi can see the past.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:59.410
You can only see the various 
future possibilities.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:04.750
But divining the future comes with risk.

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:09.290
So fangshi have everything to 
lose by divining the future.

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.910
How much damage you take depends on

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.870
the strength of the effect the results 
of your prediction have on the world.

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:25.490
For example, divining the results 
of the lottery won't hurt me.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:30.820
All it does is change who 
will become a nouveau riche.

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:38.780
But just divining a bit of the fate of 
this Raten Taishou nearly killed me.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:46.200
Honestly, it doesn't matter to 
me what happens to you guys.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:54.330
No matter how bad things get, I'm strong 
enough to protect myself and my family.

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:57.720
So why did I come here?

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.090
Broadly speaking, two reasons.

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:03.980
First, if I didn't come,

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:07.760
the Tenshi and the Tenshifu's honor 
would be severely damaged.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:12.450
I couldn't stand to see 
the Tenshi lose face.

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:17.350
Second, to give you a new choice.

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:20.330
The choice to give up.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.710
Give up?

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:25.460
You mean give up on 
becoming the next Tenshi?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:30.030
It doesn't matter how this 
tournament turns out.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:35.380
I mean the choice to give up 
on searching for the truth.

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:40.040
Do that and you'll get what you want most.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.460
Don't be absurd!

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:44.100
What's wrong with wanting the truth?

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.570
It's what I want most!

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.890
You want the truth, huh?

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:57.710
But once people achieve one goal, 
their eyes move to the next.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.440
Your desires can never be satisfied.

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:03.260
Your wants will increase.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:08.200
Eventually, you'll forget 
what you wanted most.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:14.710
What I meant is the thing you'll never 
have, no matter how much you want it.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.810
What you'd give everything to have.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:23.000
That's what you call the thing 
you truly want the most.

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:25.880
Quit lecturing me!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:28.230
You know nothing about me!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:32.290
You don't know what I want most!

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:36.520
"Respond to all situations with calmness,

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.030
and you will always be pure."

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.780
What's that?

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.270
The Elders' Sutra of Purity.

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:47.860
"Always be pure"?

00:19:48.780 --> 00:19:53.870
Maybe it sounds nice, 
but it's not that easy to do.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:58.660
In order to get what you want most,

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:01.130
you have to give something else up.

00:20:01.960 --> 00:20:05.570
I more or less get it.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:11.550
If I keep seeking the truth, 
my future will head in a bad direction.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:13.570
That's what you mean, right?

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:21.700
Ouya-san, I'm not the only one who will 
be affected by that future, am I?

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:24.740
Otherwise there would be no reason for you

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.820
to get involved with someone who 
has nothing to do with you.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:32.950
Let me explain another concept to you.

00:20:33.350 --> 00:20:36.010
I call it the weight of fate.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:39.900
This world never stops, 
not even for an instant.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.860
It's constantly changing.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:46.010
Even a single pebble weathering 
away is part of change.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:51.800
Me eating this pickle is part of change.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:58.570
But the effect a change has on the 
world depends on the object itself.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:03.010
Some fail to have any influence 
no matter how much they struggle,

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:07.120
while others cause turbulent 
times with a single decision.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:11.330
It all happens because of the difference 
in the weight of their fate.

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:17.320
And Chou Soran, your fate 
is unbelievably heavy.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:23.620
Your choices will change the fates of many.

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.120
I have a question.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:34.510
What effect did choosing to come 
and convince me have on your fate?

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:39.820
Well, I'm sure it'll mean trouble for me.

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:45.400
Whew, I'm stuffed.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:47.470
I can't eat any more.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:50.670
Chou Soran...

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:53.530
What will you do?

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.170
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.180 --> 00:23:27.870
A mantou eating contest? Is this a joke?

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:28.410
Cucumbers!

00:23:28.410 --> 00:23:28.890
Huh?

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:30.590
We'll settle this by eating cucumbers!

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.010
You're not making any sense.

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:33.240
Will you or won't you?

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:34.690
B-Bring it on.

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:37.240
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "An Old Enemy."

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:39.940
<b>12: An Old Enemy</b>

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:39.180
But I hate cucumbers!
